      "text_raw": "When the average input\nvoltage goes up, for exam-\nple, up to the supply voltage,\nthe pMOSTs drop out.\nIndeed, the voltage across\nthe two diodes has dropped\nto below the V voltage and\nZ\ndrops out. They are omitted\nfrom the figure in this slide.\nAs a consequence, all the\ncurrent 8I has to flow in\nB\nthe two nMOST transistors.\nThey both carry a current\nof 4I , which is four\nB\ntimes larger than before.\nTheir transconductance now\ndoubles.",
